>**{c=red:You must zone and wait until the next game day after completing }{q:The Unfinished Waltz|The Unfinished Waltz|The Unfinished Waltz}{c=red: to begin this quest.}**
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Laila} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (G-7).
** To complete this quest, you must have a {@i:Yagudo Glue|2558} {i:Block of Yagudo Glue|Block of Yagudo Glue|2558}. It would save time to obtain it before the next step.
*** Obtained from {m:Yagudo Piper}, {m:Yagudo Lutenist}, {m:Yagudo Chanter}, {m:Yagudo Conductor}, or {m:Yagudo Drummer} in a Shadowreign zone.
**** See the **{i:Yagudo Glue|Yagudo Glue|2558}** page for details on which zones these mobs are located in.
**** If you have the {p:Survival Guide}, the easiest way to obtain this is by taking it to {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} and farming inside {z:Castle Oztroja (S)}.
* Zone into {z:Jugner Forest (S)} for a cutscene.
** The fastest way to do this is to warp to the {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Batallia Downs (S)} if you have it.
* Examine the **Glowing Pebbles** in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} (I-5) for a cutscene.
* Trade the {@i:Yagudo Glue|2558} Yagudo Glue to the **Glowing Pebbles** in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} (I-5).
** You must be on {p:Dancer} to obtain this cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Laila} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (G-7) for a cutscene and your reward.
** You must be on {p:Dancer} to obtain this cutscene.

=4 Artifact Trace
After finishing the quest The Road to Divadom and speaking to {n:Olgald} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (G-7), you may commission {p:Dancer} {i:Artifact Armor} from Matthias. Matthias can be found on a bridge near the music store in Bastok Markets ({p:Home Point} #4 is closest). You can choose the order in which you receive the armor and may commission a new piece immediately after the last piece is completed.
